{"id":686,"date":"2022-12-28T06:18:02","date_gmt":"2022-12-28T06:18:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/?page_id=686"},"modified":"2026-03-22T07:32:18","modified_gmt":"2026-03-22T07:32:18","slug":"personal-injury","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/personal-injury\/","title":{"rendered":"PERSONAL INJURY LAWYERS IN  CALIFORNIA"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-686\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-686-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-686-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-686-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Watch: How Our Oakland Personal Injury Attorneys Can Help You<\/h2>\n<p>Learn how our top-rated personal injury attorneys in Oakland, CA, fight for accident victims and secure the compensation they deserve. Call <a href=\"tel:6673501072\">(667) 350-1072<\/a> today for a free consultation.<\/p>\n<div class=\"video-container\"><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo.jsonp\" async><\/script><br \/>\n<script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/assets\/external\/E-v1.js\" async><\/script><\/p>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height: 100%; left: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 100%;\"><span class=\"wistia_embed wistia_async_gadw8m3bgo popover=true videoFoam=true\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: 100%; position: relative; width: 100%;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n  \"name\": \"How Our Oakland Personal Injury Attorneys Can Help\",\n  \"description\": \"Watch this video to learn how Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm fights for personal injury victims in Oakland, CA, helping them recover compensation for medical bills, lost wages, and pain and suffering.\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/video-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"uploadDate\": \"2024-11-01\",\n  \"contentUrl\": \"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo\",\n  \"embedUrl\": \"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo\",\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo.png\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n<\/script><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-686-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2>Oakland Personal Injury Attorneys: Get the Compensation You Deserve<\/h2>\n<p>Looking for the <strong data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1627\">top personal injury lawyers in the Bay Area<\/strong>? At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we help accident victims secure the compensation they deserve. Our legal team has won over $257 million in settlements for injury victims across the Bay Area. Whether you were injured in a car accident, slip and fall, or workplace incident, our experienced attorneys are here to fight for you.. As leading <strong>personal injury attorneys in Oakland, CA<\/strong>, we have successfully represented thousands of injured clients, securing over <strong>$257 million<\/strong> in settlements and verdicts. Contact us today for a free consultation\u2014call <a href=\"tel:6673501072\">(667) 350-1072<\/a> or fill out our <a href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/contact\/\">online contact form<\/a> to get started.<\/p>\n<h3>Types of Cases Our Top Personal Injury Lawyers\u00a0 Handle<\/h3>\n<p>At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, our team of experienced <strong>Oakland personal injury attorneys<\/strong> specializes in handling a wide range of injury claims. Whether you\u2019ve suffered a catastrophic injury, been in a car accident, or are dealing with workplace negligence, we have the skills and resources to fight for your compensation.\u00a0 According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.courts.ca.gov\/selfhelp-torts.htm\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"927\">California Courts Self-Help Guide<\/a>, personal injury victims may be entitled to significant compensation.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Personal Injury Claims We Handle:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Workplace Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Catastrophic Injuries<\/li>\n<li>Spinal Cord Injuries<\/li>\n<li>Brain Injuries<\/li>\n<li>Slip and Fall Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Dog Bites and Animal Attacks<\/li>\n<li>Product Liability Cases<\/li>\n<li>Wrongful Death<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>Motor Vehicle Accident Cases<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>We have extensive experience representing clients in complex <strong>motor vehicle accident<\/strong> cases, including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Car Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Motorcycle Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Truck Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Pedestrian Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Bicycle Accidents<\/li>\n<li>Rideshare Accidents (Uber\/Lyft)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-690 size-large lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"Oakland Car Accident Attorneys - Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/car-accident-image.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/768;\" \/><\/p>\n<h3><strong>Steps to Take After an Accident<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Taking the right steps after an accident can protect both your health and your legal claim:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remain calm and move to a safe location.<\/li>\n<li>Seek medical attention immediately.<\/li>\n<li>Call the police and request an official accident report.<\/li>\n<li>Gather evidence, including photos, witness information, and insurance details.<\/li>\n<li>Avoid admitting fault or discussing details with others.<\/li>\n<li>Contact an experienced <strong>Oakland personal injury lawyer<\/strong> to discuss your legal options.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Who Can You Sue? Personal Injury Lawyers in Oakland Explain<\/h3>\n<p>Determining liability is a crucial step in securing compensation. Responsible parties may include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Negligent drivers<\/li>\n<li>Property owners<\/li>\n<li>Employers<\/li>\n<li>Product manufacturers<\/li>\n<li>Public entities (e.g., city transportation services)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1380 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train-1024x585.jpg\" alt=\"Train Accident Lawyers in Oakland, CA - Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train-300x171.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train-768x439.jpg 768w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train-1536x878.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/train.jpg 1792w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/585;\" \/><\/p>\n<h3><strong>How Much is My Personal Injury Case Worth?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>The value of your case depends on factors such as medical expenses, lost wages, pain and suffering, and long-term disability. You may be eligible to recover:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Economic Damages:<\/strong> Medical bills, lost income, rehabilitation costs<\/li>\n<li><strong>Non-Economic Damages:<\/strong> Pain and suffering, emotional distress, loss of companionship<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>Why Choose Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>Oakland personal injury lawyers<\/strong> are recognized for their expertise and commitment to maximizing client settlements. Here\u2019s why injury victims trust us:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Proven Results:<\/strong> Over $257 million recovered for clients<\/li>\n<li><strong>No Fees Unless We Win:<\/strong> We work on a contingency fee basis<\/li>\n<li><strong>Personalized Attention:<\/strong> We treat each client like family<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>Contact an Experienced Oakland Personal Injury Attorney Today<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>If you\u2019ve been injured in an accident, don\u2019t wait to seek legal representation. The sooner you act, the stronger your case will be. Contact Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm today for a <strong>free case evaluation<\/strong>. Call <a href=\"tel:6673501072\">(667) 350-1072<\/a> or fill out our <a href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/contact\/\">online contact form<\/a> to get started.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-686-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-686-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" da